---
const projects = [
  { name: 'CYN-X', tag: 'INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS', desc: 'A personal AI ecosystem exploring models, interfaces, services, software and connected devices.', href: '/cyn-x/' },
  { name: 'Barkly Chem Lab', tag: 'GAMES & CREATIVE PROJECTS', desc: 'A modded Minecraft playground for experimentation, progression, farming, technology, space and a little chaos.', href: 'https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/barkly-chem-lab' },
  { name: 'PawBoard', tag: 'HARDWARE & ACCESSIBILITY', desc: 'Exploring modular hardware and computing ideas with people-centered design in mind.', href: '/pawboard/' },
];
---

<title>Founder | Barkly Labs</title>
<meta name="description" content="Meet Piper, the independent founder behind Barkly Labs." />

<main class="founder-page">
  <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">BARKLY LABS</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>FOUNDER</span>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="kicker"><span class="status-dot"></span> INDEPENDENT LAB / DETROIT, MI</p>
      <p class="section-number">PERSON / 001</p>
      <h1>Hi, I'm<br /><span>Piper.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">I'm the person behind Barkly Labs.</p>
      <p class="hero-copy">An independent software engineer and creator building projects, experimenting with ideas, and trying to make technology a little more human.</p>
      <div class="hero-stamp"><span class="stamp-mark">B</span><span>FOUNDER<br />INDEPENDENTLY BUILT<br />NOT A CORPORATION</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <div class="section-label"><span>01</span> / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div>
    <div class="section-layout">
      <h2 id="about-heading">Curiosity is what<br />gets me <span>building.</span></h2>
      <div class="section-copy">
        <p>Barkly Labs is an independent project founded and built by me. It's where I bring together software engineering, AI, hardware, creative projects, games and ideas I want to explore.</p>
        <p>I learn by doing: trying things, making prototypes, breaking them, fixing them, documenting what I learn and sharing the things that grow out of those experiments. Not every idea starts polished. That's part of the process.</p>
        <p>I want this lab to be a place where curiosity is welcome, accessibility is taken seriously, and technology is built to support people—not make them feel like they have to fit into it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section principles" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
    <div class="section-label"><span>02</span> / WHAT I BELIEVE</div>
    <h2 id="principles-heading">The ideas behind<br />the work.</h2>
    <div class="principle-grid">
      <article><span class="card-index">01 / DIGNITY</span><h3>People are people, not numbers.</h3><p>People deserve to be treated with dignity, not reduced to metrics or assumptions.</p></article>
      <article><span class="card-index">02 / ACCESS</span><h3>Technology should adapt.</h3><p>Tools should meet people where they are and make room for different needs and ways of working.</p></article>
      <article><span class="card-index">03 / CURIOSITY</span><h3>Curiosity belongs here.</h3><p>Experimentation, learning, creativity and mistakes are part of building something meaningful.</p></article>
      <article><span class="card-index">04 / PRACTICE</span><h3>Build openly and thoughtfully.</h3><p>Document the work, be honest about what's in progress, and keep learning from others.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <div class="section-label"><span>03</span> / THINGS I'M BUILDING</div>
    <h2 id="projects-heading">Ideas in<br /><span>the lab.</span></h2>
    <p class="section-lead">A few projects and directions I'm exploring through Barkly Labs.</p>
    <div class="project-grid">
      {projects.map((project, i) => (
        <article class="project-card">
          <div class="project-top"><span>PROJECT / 0{i + 1}</span><span class="project-tag">{project.tag}</span></div>
          <h3>{project.name}</h3>
          <p>{project.desc}</p>
          <a href={project.href} class="project-link">EXPLORE <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="section-label"><span>04</span> / WHY BARKLY</div>
    <h2>Where ideas<br />meet <span>care.</span></h2>
    <p>Barkly Labs is still growing. I'm building it one experiment, one project and one idea at a time. Thanks for being here and taking a look at what I'm making.</p>
    <a class="button-link" href="/">RETURN TO BARKLY LABS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>

  <footer class="page-footer"><span>BARKLY LABS / FOUNDER</span><span>INDEPENDENTLY BUILT · DETROIT, MI</span></footer>
</main>

